ecialists in Government hospitals, State-wise;\r\n(b) whether Government has assessed the impact of these vacancies on healthcare delivery; and\r\n(c) the steps taken to fill these vacancies within a fixed timeline?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":29,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU2683_xkdpjX.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2683_xkdpjX.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU2683_xkdpjX.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU2683_xkdpjX.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU2683_xkdpjX.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2683_xkdpjX.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2678,"qslno":328051,"qtitle":"Effect of economic factor on MSMEs","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"10.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-10T00:00:00","shri":"Dr.       ","qno":2482,"name":"Menaka Guruswamy                        ","min_name":"MICRO, SMALL AND MEDIUM ENTERPRISES","qn_text":"(a) the number of MSMEs that have ceased operations or become inactive due to GST compliance, rising input costs and other economic factors;\r\n(b) whether Government has conducted any assessment in this regard; and\r\n(c) if so, the details thereof?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU2482_Sn1xJP.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2482_Sn1xJP.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU2482_Sn1xJP.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU2482_Sn1xJP.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU2482_Sn1xJP.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2482_Sn1xJP.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2678,"qslno":327993,"qtitle":"Commercial coal mining","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"10.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-10T00:00:00","shri":"Dr.       ","qno":2419,"name":"Menaka Guruswamy                        ","min_name":"COAL","qn_text":"(a) the number of commercial coal blocks auctio